standing.

> I'm not even sure if level 5 is too low  to successfully traverse the
> area.

Level 5 seems okay, but that property doesn't tell too much; it would
be interesting to know e.g. about your armor. (Still robe and gloves?)

> Any tips on navigation or somesuch would be most welcome.  Minimal
> spoilers appreciated, if that's possible.

The problem with mines is that you cannot retreat into corridors and
can get surrounded by monsters. The problem with unlit mines is that
you have to explore many more squares of the floor until you find the
stairs; that means you have a significant higher probability to step
into some trap (which can spoil your game quickly). In case the level
is dark; if you have got some means to dig, you may try digging down
though the floor; you may land in some area where you are guaranteed
to find some lighting tools. Otherwise keep close to walls to explore
the border of the mines and then the interior until you find the
stairs.

> Thanks much,
